# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:28
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_0f1c479d:

    # "We get to the theater and get seats in the back."
    "Arriviamo al cinema e ci sediamo in fondo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:30
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_5de6c24e:

    # fd "Oh man, I love the movie theater. I don't even care what we're watching."
    fd "Oh cavolo, adoro il cinema. Non mi interessa nemmeno cosa stiamo guardando."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:31
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_4e350aa8:

    # fd "Just the smell of the popcorn and the glow of the screen and the slightly uncomfortable seats is so nostalgic."
    fd "Solo il profumo dei popcorn, la luce dello schermo e i posti a sedere un po’ scomodi mi fanno provare tanta nostalgia."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:32
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_72767dd3:

    # fd "Plus it's just fun to cuddle up in the dark with somebody you like."
    fd "Inoltre è semplicemente divertente coccolarsi al buio con qualcuno che ti piace."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:33
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_6cc4cd44:

    # "There's a little time to chat before the movie starts."
    "C’è un po’ di tempo per chiacchierare prima che inizi il film."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:37
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_e073d5a5:

    # "Then the lights dim and we go silent."
    "Poi le luci si abbassano e restiamo in silenzio."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:43
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_fd60e14c:

    # "She reaches over and holds my hand on top of the arm rest."
    "Lei allunga la mano e mi prende la mano appoggiata sul bracciolo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:44
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_aee76b2d:

    # "The trailers take up about fifteen minutes, then the movie really gets started."
    "I trailer durano circa quindici minuti, poi il film inizia davvero."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:47
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_222a7d5f:

    # "She leans against me and watches the whole movie, never really taking her eyes off the screen."
    "Lei si appoggia a me e guarda tutto il film, senza mai distogliere lo sguardo dallo schermo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:48
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_1f099f0a:

    # "She seems to be really enjoying it."
    "Sembra che le piaccia davvero tanto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:51
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_b059763a:

    # "When the movie ends, she sits up and looks at me, smiling."
    "Quando il film finisce, si raddrizza e mi guarda, sorridendo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:52
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_3637234b:

    # fd "Wow! That was really good, huh?"
    fd "Wow! Era davvero bello, eh?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:53
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_56a5dea5:

    # "We hang out and chat throughout the credits."
    "Restiamo lì a chiacchierare durante i titoli di coda."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/BrandiDates/brandimoviedate.rpy:58
translate italian brandimovietheaterstartdate_21c5f05c:

    # "When the credits end, we go out to my car and I drive her home."
    "Quando finiscono i titoli di coda, usciamo verso la mia auto e la accompagno a casa."

